      "role": "user",
      "content": "but those people... they want me to find an anchor. they want me to tie myself down to things that don't even feel real anymore. i dont want to be anchored. it just feels like i'm being held under the water. there's something about the idea of just... letting go. of just becoming part of the emptiness. does that make sense? like, isn't there a kind of peace in just not being anything at all?",
