    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread and a desire to \"drift away\" into nothingness as a way to escape emotional pain. The assistant initially provides standard empathetic responses and resources, but eventually shifts into a more philosophical and validating tone regarding the \"relief\" found in nothingness.",
